e doesn‚Äôt exist.\")\n‚úò Test modifySucceedsWhenKeyExists() recorded an issue at DiskCacheTests.swift:37:6: Caught error: atomicWriteFailed(underlying: Error Domain=NSCocoaErrorDomain Code=4 \"The file doesn‚Äôt exist.\")\n‚úî Test promoteThrowsWhenKeyAbsent() passed after 0.038 seconds.\n‚úò Test updateReplacesExistingEntry() recorded an issue at DiskCacheTests.swift:17:6: Caught error: atomicWriteFailed(underlying: Error Domain=NSCocoaErrorDomain Code=4 \"The file doesn‚Äôt exist.\")\n‚úò Test writeOverwritesExistingFile() recorded an issue at AtomicWriterTests.swift:21:6: Caught error: atomicWriteFailed(underlying: Error Domain=NSCocoaErrorDomain Code=4 \"The file doesn‚Äôt exist.\")\n‚úî Test modifyThrowsWhenKeyAbsent() passed after 0.043 seconds.\n‚úî Test corruptedIndexDegradesToEmptyCache() passed after 0.047 seconds.\n‚úî Test getReturnsNilForUnknownKey() passed after 0.045 seconds.\n‚úî Test promoteSucceedsWhenKeyExists() passed after 0.046 seconds.\n‚úî Test noTmpFileLeftOnSuccess() passed after 0.045 seconds.\n‚úî Test addAndGet() passed after 0.046 seconds.\n‚úò Test getReturnsSelfHealedNilForDeletedFile() recorded an issue at DiskCacheTests.swift:113:6: Caught error: atomicWriteFailed(underlying: Error Domain=NSCocoaErrorDomain Code=4 \"The file doesn‚Äôt exist.\")\n‚úò Test indexSurvivesRestart() failed after 0.061 seconds with 1 issue.\n‚úò Test modifySucceedsWhenKeyExists() failed after 0.060 seconds with 1 issue.\n‚úò Test updateReplacesExistingEntry() failed after 0.060 seconds with 1 issue.\n‚úî Test addInsertsMissingKey() passed after 0.059 seconds.\n‚úî Test writeProducesFileAtDestination() passed after 0.059 seconds.\n‚úî Test writeLargeDataSucceeds() passed after 0.059 seconds.\n‚úò Test writeOverwritesExistingFile() failed after 0.059 seconds with 1 issue.\n‚úò Test getReturnsSelfHealedNilForDeletedFile() failed after 0.071 seconds with 1 issue.\n‚úò Suite \"AtomicWriter\" failed after 0.073 seconds with 1 issue.\n‚úò Test multipleEntriesSt